---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /staff/
title: Our Pastor & Staff
description: "Meet the pastor, ministers, and staff who serve Community Baptist Church of West Covina in Baldwin Park, CA."
hero:
  eyebrow: Serving With Joy
  title: "Our Pastor & Staff"
  intro: Meet the men and women God has called to shepherd, serve, and care for our church family.
---
<section class="section section-tight" aria-labelledby="pastor-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="pastor-profile reveal">
      <div class="pastor-photo">
        {%- if church.pastor.photo %}
        <img src="{{ church.pastor.photo }}" alt="{{ church.pastor.name or 'Our pastor' }}" width="240" height="240">
        {%- else %}
        {% emblem "pastor-emblem", "" %}
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our Shepherd</p>
        <h2 id="pastor-heading">{{ church.pastor.name or "Our Pastor" }}</h2>
        <p class="pastor-role">{{ church.pastor.title }}</p>
        {%- if church.pastor.bio %}
        <p>{{ church.pastor.bio }}</p>
        {%- else %}
        <p>{{ church.pastor.welcome[1] }}</p>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-ivory" aria-labelledby="team-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Ministry Leaders</p>
      <h2 id="team-heading" class="section-title">Serving Our Church Family</h2>
      <p>These faithful servants lead our ministries and keep our church running with love and care.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="staff-grid">
      {%- for person in staff %}
      <article class="staff-card reveal">
        <div class="staff-photo">
          {%- if person.photo %}
          <img src="{{ person.photo }}" alt="{{ person.name or person.role }}" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500">
          {%- else %}
          <div class="staff-photo-placeholder">
            {% emblem "staff-emblem", "" %}
            <span>Photo coming soon</span>
          </div>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="staff-info">
          <p class="staff-role">{{ person.role }}</p>
          <h3>{{ person.name or "Name coming soon" }}</h3>
          {% if person.bio %}<p class="staff-bio">{{ person.bio }}</p>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container center reveal">
    <h2 class="section-title">Come Meet Us in Person</h2>
    <p class="lead-dark" style="max-width: 46ch; margin-inline: auto;">Our pastor and staff would love to welcome you this Sunday.</p>
    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 1.8rem;">
      <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/visit/">Plan Your Visit{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline btn-lg" href="/contact/">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
